Version 2026.07.01
------------
- Bug fix: unbounded atexit() handler registration in open_rtc(): timedated leaked ~3 MB of RSS per day of uptime.
  After upgradepkg on systems that do not often reboot:
    sudo ls -l /proc/$(pgrep -x timedated)/exe <- old pgrep N
    sudo kill $(pgrep -x timedated) <- kill daemon
    timedatectl status <- start daemon new version
    sudo ls -l /proc/$(pgrep -x timedated)/exe <- new pgrep N means new version active

